WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.130
Last step.

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.690
Tap 'Copy prompt and open Grok',

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.790
or Claude.

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.700
Paste it in and send.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.040
Your trainer says hi, then asks for a screenshot of your inbox

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:10.790
list.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.700
Send it, and you'll get your email sorted into what needs you

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.780
today, what can wait, and what you can skip,

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.600
plus drafts for your top two replies.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.530
You read them and you send them.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.784
That's your first win.

